as you wield makeshift weapons and items you've gathered in the corridors of the building.\nImpeccable Body Horror AestheticMeet your macabre fate in a bizarre world teeming with an unconventional and occasionally psychotic cast of characters - some of which you can recruit and offer safe harbor in your apartment as the mystery unravels.\nSmall, Experimental, and Unwaveringly WeirdOffering 3 - 6 hours of playtime with a dozen boss encounters, friends to recruit, and visitors to invite back to your home, Look Outside offers different experiences for every player on their way to uncover several different endings."}